&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Come join the organization that is redefining security for the AI era. As one of the&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wiz.io/blog/100m-arr-in-18-months-wiz-becomes-the-fastest-growing-software-company-ever&quot;&gt; fastest-growing startups ever,&lt;/a&gt; we enable teams to secure cloud and AI applications by connecting code, cloud, and runtime into a single shared context. Trusted by security teams all over the world, we have a proven&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.g2.com/products/wiz-wiz/reviews&quot;&gt; track record of success&lt;/a&gt; and a culture that values world-class talent. Not to mention, we&#39;re now&lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.google.com/blog/products/identity-security/google-completes-acquisition-of-wiz&quot;&gt; powered by Google&lt;/a&gt;, meaning we offer our customers an AI-powered platform that harnesses Google’s Threat Intelligence and Security Operations to better detect, prevent, and respond to threats across all environments, allowing for further innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Wizards from all over the globe work together to protect the infrastructure of our customers, including over 65% of the Fortune 100, who trust us to scan and secure over 230 billion files daily. We’re honored to be a leading player in a massive and growing market, and we continue to look for exceptional Wizards who are eager to make a significant impact on our team. At Wiz, you’ll have the freedom to think creatively, dream big, and use your full range of skills to contribute to our momentous growth. Come join our team and help us create secure cloud environments that allow even the best companies to move faster, all while having some fun!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Technical Account Manager (TAM), you’ll be responsible for planning and executing strategies to drive customer adoption and use of the Wiz platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideally based in France,&lt;/strong&gt; you will provide both strategic and hands-on technical guidance to customers throughout the Wiz journey, from onboarding to operationalization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Technical expertise and strong customer-facing skills will be essential in address both the business and technical needs of our customers. Serving as the bridge between customers and the broader Wiz team, you&#39;ll streamline collaboration between Product Management, Sales, Engineering and Support for a cohesive customer experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join Wiz as a TAM to contribute to customer success and to be a part of an innovative and collaborative company that values excellence and growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide customers with expert guidance on deployment, operational best practices, and assist in establishing a Wiz Center of Excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary Wiz liaison for technical questions or escalations, collaborating with Support, Product Management, and other relevant teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to workshops aimed at helping customers unlock the full value of the Wiz platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop trusted advisor relationships and establish a regular cadence with customer stakeholders from practitioners to C-level, with a focus on increasing adoption, ensuring retention, and fostering satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help customers develop Success Plans, outlining critical goals and key performance indicators, and provide guidance in achieving these objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure customers’ achievement of these key performance indicators and report those both internally and externally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and address technical issues to ensure high levels of customer satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Engineering and Support teams to resolve technical escalations quickly and efficiently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for customer needs across various departments (product management, support, ...).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Offer insights regarding the availability of new features in Wiz.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Program manage account escalations effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the Wiz Sales and Renewal teams to secure contract renewals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in identifying opportunities for expanding Wiz usage across the customer’s organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain up-to-date functional and technical knowledge of the Wiz platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously monitor news related to new &amp;amp; emerging cloud security threats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow your knowledge of the Wiz ecosystem (Cloud Service Providers, Technology partners, ...)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in technical customer facing roles, for example: Technical Account Manager, Professional Services, Solutions Engineering, Technical Support, Customer Success Engineer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of cloud services, architectures, and security best practices, with CSP level certifications (e.g., Certified Solutions Architect, Certified DevOps Engineer) preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with container technologies (Docker, Kubernetes) and the security considerations associated with them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills, with the ability to troubleshoot complex technical issues and drive resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of building and maintaining relationships with enterprise clients, driving customer success, and exceeding performance targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and interpersonal skills, with the ability to effectively engage with stakeholders at all levels of an organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B.S. in Computer Science, Engineering, or similar field, or equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent English and French&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;Applicants must have the legal right to work in the country where the position is based,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;without the need for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;visa &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;sponsorship.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;This&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt; role does not offer&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;visa&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;sponsorship&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wiz is an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, reproductive health decisions, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, genetic information, political views or activity, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you acknowledge that Wiz will process your personal data in accordance with &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wiz.io/legal/privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Wiz&#39;s Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Come join the organization that is redefining security for the AI era. As one of the&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wiz.io/blog/100m-arr-in-18-months-wiz-becomes-the-fastest-growing-software-company-ever&quot;&gt; fastest-growing startups ever,&lt;/a&gt; we enable teams to secure cloud and AI applications by connecting code, cloud, and runtime into a single shared context. Trusted by security teams all over the world, we have a proven&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.g2.com/products/wiz-wiz/reviews&quot;&gt; track record of success&lt;/a&gt; and a culture that values world-class talent. Not to mention, we&#39;re now&lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.google.com/blog/products/identity-security/google-completes-acquisition-of-wiz&quot;&gt; powered by Google&lt;/a&gt;, meaning we offer our customers an AI-powered platform that harnesses Google’s Threat Intelligence and Security Operations to better detect, prevent, and respond to threats across all environments, allowing for further innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Wizards from all over the globe work together to protect the infrastructure of our customers, including over 65% of the Fortune 100, who trust us to scan and secure over 230 billion files daily. We’re honored to be a leading player in a massive and growing market, and we continue to look for exceptional Wizards who are eager to make a significant impact on our team. At Wiz, you’ll have the freedom to think creatively, dream big, and use your full range of skills to contribute to our momentous growth. Come join our team and help us create secure cloud environments that allow even the best companies to move faster, all while having some fun!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;59&quot;&gt;Role Description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;76&quot;&gt;Wiz is seeking an Enterprise Account Executive to drive the expansion of our cloud security market footprint. In this role, you will be responsible for developing, managing, and closing strategic business opportunities within the enterprise ecosystem. You will serve as a trusted advisor to C-level executives, particularly CISOs, translating technical value into clear business outcomes. Collaborating cross-functionally with Solutions Engineering, Customer Success, Product, and Marketing, you will build deep, lasting customer relationships while consistently meeting and exceeding growth objectives in alignment with core Wiz values.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;717&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;736&quot;&gt;Demonstrate an intimate understanding of Wiz Cloud Security Solutions and their value to our customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;841&quot;&gt;Position and advise to C-level level executives with industry Point-of-View business insights, listening to, building, and growing executive relationships with customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1010&quot;&gt;Develop and close business to consistently meet or exceed quarterly sales quotas, in a way that reflects Wiz values.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1128&quot;&gt;Align with Wiz partner ecosystem to optimize market opportunity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1194&quot;&gt;Maintain accurate pipeline management with expert-level forecasting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Build effective working relationships with Solutions Engineering, Customer Success, Product, Marketing, Delivery, and Executive teams to ensure strategy alignment and achieve company objectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1462&quot;&gt;Minimum qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1487&quot;&gt;5 years of experience selling enterprise solutions in the cloud or cybersecurity space.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1576&quot;&gt;Proven track record of effective selling at the Enterprise level throughout the designated territory.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1679&quot;&gt;Experience managing accounts and driving growth in the cloud or cybersecurity ecosystem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1769&quot;&gt;Experience collaborating with cross-functional internal business units and their stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1867&quot;&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1894&quot;&gt;Established, positive relationships with previous sales operations teams and partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Ability to employ a consultative, professional approach to customer engagements, with the agility to pivot dynamically in meetings.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2115&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to build trust and advise C-level executives with industry-relevant point-of-view insights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2229&quot;&gt;Passion for aligning with partner ecosystems to maximize market opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2229&quot;&gt;Proficiency in French, both written and spoken, is a bonus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;Applicants must have the legal right to work in the country where the position is based,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;without the need for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;visa &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;sponsorship.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;This&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt; role does not offer&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;visa&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;sponsorship&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wiz is an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, reproductive health decisions, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, genetic information, political views or activity, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you acknowledge that Wiz will process your personal data in accordance with &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wiz.io/legal/privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Wiz&#39;s Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Proton and build a better internet where privacy is the default&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2014 by scientists who met at CERN, Proton was built on the belief that &lt;strong&gt;privacy is a fundamental human right&lt;/strong&gt;. What started as an encrypted email service has grown into an ecosystem of privacy-first products, including Proton Mail, VPN, Drive, Pass, and Calendar, used by millions of people worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re profitable, independent, and building for the long term. Free from venture capital control and advertising-driven business models, we focus on what matters most: our users. Our work helps protect digital freedom, from everyday privacy to supporting journalists and activists in challenging environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, we&#39;re an international team of 700+ people, with offices across 9 countries. We have high standards for the people we hire and the work we do. You&#39;ll work alongside talented, driven colleagues who challenge each other, take ownership, and care about getting things right.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Explore our &lt;a href=&quot;https://proton.me/community/open-source&quot;&gt;open-source projects&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your impact:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re hiring Product Engineers at senior and staff levels.&lt;/strong&gt; If you’ve led complex technical projects and want to keep building hands-on, we’d love to hear from you. Your scope and level will reflect your experience and the impact you can bring.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Product Engineer (Full-Stack), you’ll help shape what we build and own work from understanding the problem through to release and improvement. You’ll speak directly with customers, collaborate with Product and Design, and work across the parts of the stack needed to deliver a complete solution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Understand and shape the problem:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with Product, Design and customers to understand user needs, question assumptions and decide what is worth building.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own complete features:&lt;/strong&gt; Turn problems into practical solutions across clients, services and data. Take work through testing, release and improvement, paying attention to usability, performance and behaviour in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build effectively with agents:&lt;/strong&gt; Define clear tasks, provide context and evaluate generated code. Investigate failures, challenge suggestions and make changes yourself when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve how software gets built:&lt;/strong&gt; Turn recurring problems into better agent instructions, tests, tools and automated safeguards. Share improvements that help the whole team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build for trust:&lt;/strong&gt; Make privacy, security, reliability and maintainability part of your decisions. Verify important failure cases, communicate what remains uncertain and make sound trade-offs about release readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience delivering production software:&lt;/strong&gt; You can explain the problems you solved, the decisions you made and what you learned from maintaining your work after release.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Frontend and backend experience:&lt;/strong&gt; You’ve built and shipped production features using at least one frontend technology (React, TypeScript or JavaScript) and at least one backend technology (Rust, PHP, Java, Python, Go or Node.js). You may be stronger on one side depending on the team, but you’re comfortable working on both.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practical capability with coding agents:&lt;/strong&gt; You’ve used agents to deliver working software and can explain how you guide them, improve unsuccessful approaches and verify their output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Code fluency and engineering judgement:&lt;/strong&gt; You can navigate unfamiliar code, trace behaviour, diagnose problems and make precise changes. You can assess an implementation regardless of who — or what — wrote it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product judgement:&lt;/strong&gt; You connect technical choices to user needs, care about the quality of the experience and distinguish a useful reduction in scope from a shortcut that puts users at risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership and collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; You move work forward through uncertainty, explain trade-offs clearly, seek out expertise and take responsibility for the outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; You’ve led complex projects through ambiguous requirements, made decisions with lasting consequences and helped other engineers develop their judgement while remaining hands-on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work that Matters:&lt;/strong&gt; Millions of people trust Proton with their privacy. We answer only to our users — not advertisers, not investors with conflicting agendas, not governments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Great Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Diverse, collaborative, and tight-knit, with people from MIT, Harvard, Stanford, Caltech, Cambridge, ETH, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology:&lt;/strong&gt; The right hardware and software to do your best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development:&lt;/strong&gt; We invest in your growth. Proton is one of the fastest ways to accelerate your career — real challenges, real ownership, from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong health coverage, solid retirement options, generous leave, and wellness support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stock Options:&lt;/strong&gt; From day one, you have a real stake in what we&#39;re building. When Proton wins, you win.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In-Person Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Offices across Geneva, Zürich, Barcelona, London, and more. You&#39;ll spend most of your time collaborating face-to-face.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Food:&lt;/strong&gt; Lunch and snacks on us every day in the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transport:&lt;/strong&gt; We cover public transport, bike allowances, or parking — whichever works for you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Working:&lt;/strong&gt; You own your schedule. Outcomes matter more than clock-in times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation range:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compensation will be discussed during the interview process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;We&#39;re hiring across multiple experience levels for this position. Your level and compensation will be determined based on your skills, experience and performance throughout the interview process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our commitment to diversity and inclusion:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Proton, we believe diversity drives innovation and strengthens our mission to provide privacy as a default for all. We are committed to fostering an inclusive environment where all individuals, regardless of race, ethnicity, gender, age, sexual orientation, physical ability, or socio-economic background, feel valued and empowered. We strive to create equal opportunities, promote open dialogue, and support continuous learning to ensure every voice is heard and respected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any extra support or reasonable adjustments during the hiring process, please let your talent partner know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate privacy notice:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you apply for a position, refer a candidate, or are considered for a role at Proton AG (&quot;Proton,&quot; &quot;we,&quot; &quot;us,&quot; or &quot;our&quot;), we store and process your information using Greenhouse, our recruitment platform. Two privacy policies apply to this information, together:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.greenhouse.com/privacy-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Greenhouse&#39;s Service Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;, which governs how Greenhouse, as our data processor, handles and secures the information within their platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://job-boards.eu.greenhouse.io/protongdpr&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Proton&#39;s Recruitment &amp;amp; Hiring Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;, which governs how we, as the data controller, use, retain, and manage your information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use your information to evaluate your suitability for the role you&#39;ve applied for. We also retain it to consider you for future roles that may align with your background and skills, unless you ask us not to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Once we no longer have a legitimate business need to process your information, we will delete or anonymize it. If you have questions about how we use or manage your data, or if you&#39;d like to access, correct, or delete it, contact our privacy team at &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Proton does not accept unsolicited resumes from any source other than directly from candidates, and we will not pay a fee for any placement resulting from an unsolicited submission, even if the candidate is later hired by Proton.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
