&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid role (3 days in the office, 2 days remote), based in our London office at HYLO, 103–105 Bunhill Row, London EC1Y 8LZ.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At JFrog, we’re reinventing the Software Supply Chain to help the world’s greatest companies innovate -- and we want you along for the ride. This is a special place with a unique combination of brilliance, spirit, and just all-around great people. Here, if you’re willing to do more, your career can take off. And since software plays a central role in everyone’s lives, you’ll be part of an important mission. Thousands of customers, including the majority of the Fortune 100, trust JFrog to manage, accelerate, and secure their software delivery from code to production -- a concept we call “liquid software.” Wouldn&#39;t it be amazing if you could join us in our journey?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a visionary, strategic, and highly experienced Director of Product Marketing, Governance to join our Product Marketing leadership team. In this role, you will take full ownership of the go-to-market strategy, category creation, and global expansion for our GRC portfolio, JFrog AppTrust. By establishing JFrog as the de facto standard in &quot;DevGovOps&quot; and software supply chain governance, you will bridge the gap between rigid compliance requirements, security needs, and high-velocity engineering. Your deep understanding of application security, governance, risk, and compliance (GRC) will translate complex regulatory frameworks into market-defining narratives. Operating as a key leader, you will accelerate enterprise adoption, pioneer a new market category, and empower organizations to make compliance a natural output of every release in an increasingly AI-driven software landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a Director of Product Marketing at JFrog you will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the GRC Portfolio Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive the global go-to-market strategy, positioning, and commercial success for JFrog AppTrust, operating as the definitive business leader for our governance, risk, and compliance offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Spearhead Category Creation:&lt;/strong&gt; Pioneer the &quot;DevGovOps&quot; and software supply chain governance category, building a new market from the ground up and establishing JFrog as the undisputed industry thought leader.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Regional Success:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead and execute targeted GTM motions to develop regional success, starting with EMEA, deeply tailoring messaging and GTM motions to regional regulatory landscapes and local compliance standards.&lt;/li&gt;
