&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Wheely&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wheely is redefining premium transportation across major cities in Europe, the US, and the Middle East. We blend cutting-edge technology with the craft of five-star chauffeuring to deliver an experience trusted by more than 100,000 active riders and 1,200 corporate accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a profitable, fast-growing scale-up with $43M raised and over $100M in annual revenue. Having recently launched in New York City, we’re expanding rapidly across the US and EMEA. If you take pride in your craft and want to help shape the next chapter of our growth, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Wheely&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wheely is redefining premium transportation across major cities in Europe, the US, and the Middle East. We blend cutting-edge technology with the craft of five-star chauffeuring to deliver an experience trusted by more than 100,000 active riders and 1,200 corporate accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a profitable, fast-growing scale-up with $43M raised and over $100M in annual revenue. Having recently launched in New York City, we’re expanding rapidly across the US and EMEA. If you take pride in your craft and want to help shape the next chapter of our growth, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About The Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Wheely, our main goal is to deliver a flawless personal chauffeur service at scale. This is a unique and challenging task, aiming to bring together the best of two worlds: traditional old-school luxury and modern tech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Associate Product Manager programme is a 12 month programme for early-career product people who want real ownership from day one in a compact, talent-dense and AI-driven organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own one of our consumer-facing product streams and lead a cross-functional team, coached by a Senior Product Manager with direct access to CEO.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the end of the programme, APMs who meet the bar are promoted to Product Manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a cross-functional team of engineers, a designer and a product analyst&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and build your team&#39;s roadmap in line with Wheely&#39;s mission&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own your team&#39;s products (existing and new) from idea, through development, to launch, growth and maintenance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internship (with the possibility to transition into full-time employment):
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Final-year student or recent graduate with a STEM degree from a top university&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-time:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A degree in a STEM or related field with strong academic results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6–12 months of relevant internship or work experience in a high-growth environment (tech, a top-tier consulting firm, investment bank or VC)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internships or work experience in a high-growth environment (product, engineering, design data)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Something you&#39;ve built or shipped (an app, feature, a side project, a startup)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills: you&#39;re comfortable digging into data / SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A sharp eye for UX/UI and high standards for detail, because the bar for a luxury service is very high&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
