&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Level Up Your Career with Zynga!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Zynga, we bring people together through the power of play. As a global leader in interactive entertainment and a proud label of Take-Two Interactive, our games have been downloaded over 6 billion times—connecting players in 175+ countries through fun, strategy, and a little friendly competition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From thrilling casino spins to epic strategy battles, mind-bending puzzles, and social word challenges, our diverse game portfolio has something for everyone. Fan-favorites and latest hits include FarmVille™, Words With Friends™, Zynga Poker™, Game of Thrones Slots Casino™, Wizard of Oz Slots™, Hit it Rich! Slots™, Wonka Slots™, Top Eleven™, Toon Blast™, Empires &amp;amp; Puzzles™, Merge Dragons!™, CSR Racing™, Harry Potter: Puzzles &amp;amp; Spells™, Match Factory™, and Color Block Jam™—plus many more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2007 and headquartered in California, our teams span North America, Europe, and Asia, working together to craft unforgettable gaming experiences. Whether you&#39;re spinning, strategizing, matching, or competing, Zynga is where fun meets innovation—and where you can take your career to the next level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us and be part of the play!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NaturalMotion is an award-winning UK game studio dedicated to crafting world-class mobile experiences. Alongside our continued live-service development on CSR Racing 2 (#1 drag racing series of all time), our team is stepping into its next chapter with an ambitious, unannounced project. Honoured for eight consecutive years as a GamesIndustry.biz Best Place to Work in the UK winner and named a Top 50 UK Game Maker in 2025 and 2026, we offer a collaborative studio culture backed by the global reach of Zynga and Take-Two Interactive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Purpose:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior UA Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join us at NaturalMotion to help build a new, unannounced mobile free-to-play action game. Within this role you will help to drive the growth, this project requires collaboration across various business divisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior position with real ownership of the outcome. You will set the direction for how we acquire players, while staying hands-on with the campaigns, data and testing that make it work. You will bring strong analytical ability, sound commercial judgement and a track record of growing mid-core mobile games efficiently and profitably, from pre-production through to global launch, in a fast-paced, dynamic environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We embrace a hybrid work environment, with regular in-person collaboration at our London office balanced with time working from home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do: &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the UA strategy and plan for the game, setting clear targets for CPI, ROAS and payback, and guiding the approach from soft launch through to worldwide launch and live operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead UA operations across key channels (social, SDK networks, programmatic and emerging platforms), staying hands-on with campaign setup, optimisation, budgeting and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own forecasting and budget planning, including monthly pacing and spend allocation by channel and region, working with Central Analytics to build and maintain player value and payback forecasts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and run structured tests (creatives, audiences, channels, bidding) to improve CPI, ROAS and IPM, and turn the learnings into repeatable best practice for the wider team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Creative / Brand and Product Marketing teams to brief concepts, review performance and iterate, and shape the creative direction of the overall GTM strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Product, Design, ASO and BI teams to support full-funnel improvements and make sure UA performance and player quality inform product and live operations decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate effectively across different business divisions, including Release Operations, Legal, and other stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor performance dashboards and surface insights, trends and opportunities, and build knowledge and understanding of data driven insights within the rest of the team through regular communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage relationships with ad networks, platforms and measurement partners, and stay current on platform updates, privacy changes, industry trends and competitive activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present UA strategy, performance and recommendations to studio leadership team and executive staff.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as an independent, self-starter capable of driving projects forward autonomously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a player champion!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobile UA or performance marketing experience, with a proven track record of scaling campaigns profitably across multiple regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience owning UA strategy and budget for free-to-play mobile games, with a strong passion for and in-depth knowledge of mid-core games-specifically shooter, RPG and / or action games-and how creatives, channels and targeting should be optimized for these games.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on expertise running campaigns on ad networks and social platforms, and a deep understanding of mobile attribution (MMPs), ad networks and UA platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and KPI-driven mindset, with experience turning LTV and payback forecasts into spend decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional data analysis skills, coupled with advanced Excel and SQL proficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience running structured testing programmes across creatives, audiences and channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience working effectively with various cross-functional stakeholders (e.g., Product Marketing, Brand / Creative, Analytics, Release Operations, Legal).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to work independently as a self-starter, owning strategy, budgets and schedules, and ability to present work to game leadership team and executive staff.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven AI proficiency, with hands-on experience using AI tools to speed up UA analysis, creative production and reporting, and running AI-driven campaign features on ad platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound judgement on when AI output can be trusted, including checking it for accuracy, platform policies and brand and IP guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding written and oral communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous UA experience for new game development through to worldwide launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on a live mobile game or app at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge and experience with midcore genres (e.g., shooters, RPG and action games).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with licensed or established IP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or using AI-assisted workflows or agents to automate UA reporting, creative testing or optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer You:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and discretionary annual bonus scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;26 days holiday, plus bank holidays &amp;amp; 2 paid personal days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6 months fully paid maternity/adoption leave and 16 weeks fully paid paternity leave (eligibility criteria applies)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan, with a double matching employer contribution&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical &amp;amp; dental insurance and healthcare cash plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life insurance, personal accident insurance and income protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and neurodiversity support programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company Employee Stock Purchase Plan (eligibility criteria applies)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fitness reimbursement plan, worth £600 per annum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly happy hours, seasonal parties and monthly social events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual rail season ticket advance and cycle to work scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are proud to be an equal opportunity employer, which means we are committed to creating and celebrating diverse thoughts, cultures, and backgrounds throughout our organization.&amp;nbsp; Employment with us is based on substantive ability, objective qualifications, and work ethic – not an individual’s race, creed, color, religion, sex or gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin or ancestry, alienage or citizenship status, physical or mental disability, pregnancy, age, genetic information, veteran status, marital status, status as a victim of domestic violence or sex offenses, reproductive health decision, or any other characteristics protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an equal opportunity employer, we are committed to providing the necessary support and accommodation to qualified individuals with disabilities, health conditions, or impairments (subject to any local qualifying requirements) to ensure their full participation in the job application or interview process. Please contact us at ----- to request any accommodations or for support related to your application for an open position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware that Zynga does not conduct job interviews or make job offers over third-party messaging apps such as Telegram, WhatsApp, or others.&amp;nbsp; Zynga also does not engage in any financial exchanges during the recruitment or onboarding process, and will never ask a candidate for their personal or financial information over an app or other unofficial chat channel.&amp;nbsp; Any attempt to do so may be the result of a scamp or phishing attack, and you should not engage.&amp;nbsp; Zynga’s&amp;nbsp; in-house recruitment team will only contact individuals through their official Company email addresses (i.e., via a zynga.com, take2games.com, naturalmotion.com, smallgiantgames.com, themavens.com, gram.gs email domain).&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Sales team at SevenRooms is on a mission to reshape the hospitality industry by empowering operators to take control of their guest relationships. We’re a passionate, high-performing group of go-getters who act as trusted advisors to restaurants and hospitality groups around the world. We take a consultative approach to sales—identifying business gaps, crafting thoughtful solutions, and helping operators reduce reliance on third-party networks. We believe in the power of hospitality, and we’re proud to partner with businesses to streamline operations and deliver magical guest experiences every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Account Executive, you’ll work directly with restaurants and hospitality groups to understand their business needs and recommend the best-fit SevenRooms solutions—from reservations and table management to online ordering and marketing automation. You’ll drive new business by adding operators to the platform and working closely with our onboarding and account teams to ensure a smooth and enthusiastic transition. This role plays a key part in helping hospitality operators thrive, combining strategic thinking, relationship-building, and product knowledge to deliver real impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and Manage a Sales Pipeline&lt;/strong&gt;. Identify and engage prospective restaurants and hospitality groups to grow your book of business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Showcase the Platform.&lt;/strong&gt; Present the value of SevenRooms through compelling demos and conversations that help operators understand how we can support their success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Sales from Start to Finish.&lt;/strong&gt; Own the full sales cycle—from prospecting and pitching to negotiation, contracting, and go-live support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver Live Product Demos.&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct live, engaging product walkthroughs both virtually and in person when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be a Trusted Partner.&lt;/strong&gt; Build strong relationships with prospects and clients, always advocating for their success and acting as a true advisor throughout the process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re excited about you because…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 3+ years of experience in hospitality technology sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re confident presenting to clients both in person and virtually&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re self-driven and comfortable working independently, whether in the office or remotely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re tech-savvy and quick to pick up new tools and platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re results-oriented and bring energy and focus to your daily work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve worked with tools like Salesforce, Outreach, or similar systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a background in hospitality or restaurants (a big plus!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re open to occasional travel into key markets to connect with clients face-to-face&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You speak fluent French and English&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are based in Paris, France&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;Notice to Applicants for Jobs Located in NYC or Remote Jobs Associated With Office in NYC Only&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use Covey as part of our hiring and/or promotional process for jobs in NYC and certain features may qualify it as an AEDT in NYC. As part of the hiring and/or promotion process, we provide Covey with job requirements and candidate submitted applications. We began using &lt;a href=&quot;https://getcovey.com/product/covey-scout-inbound&quot;&gt;Covey Scout for Inbound&lt;/a&gt; from August 21, 2023, through December 21, 2023, and resumed using &lt;a href=&quot;https://getcovey.com/product/covey-scout-inbound&quot;&gt;Covey Scout for Inbound&lt;/a&gt; again on June 29, 2024.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Covey tool has been reviewed by an independent auditor. Results of the audit may be viewed here: &lt;a style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot; href=&quot;https://getcovey.com/nyc-local-law-144&quot;&gt;Covey&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About SevenRooms&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In 2011, Joel Montaniel, Allison Page, and Kinesh Patel founded SevenRooms after noticing that hospitality operators were missing a critical ingredient in the systems they were using to run their business: guest data. What began as a mission to help restaurants better understand and serve their guests evolved into a powerful platform used by merchants around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With best-in-class tools for marketing, operations, and guest experience — all deeply integrated with its industry-leading CRM — SevenRooms empowers operators to drive revenue, streamline operations, and deliver experiences that keep guests coming back.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In 2025, DoorDash acquired SevenRooms to strengthen its in-store strategy and expand its merchant-first offerings. The combination brings together DoorDash’s scale, reach, and digital innovation with SevenRooms’ in-store capabilities to support hospitality businesses across every channel — from discovery and delivery to on-premise dining.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As DoorDash builds out its in-store capabilities, SevenRooms plays a central role in enabling merchants to grow their businesses and connect more meaningfully with guests, whether they’re ordering online or dining in. This move reflects DoorDash’s broader commitment to empowering local businesses, fostering stronger connections between consumers and the places they love, and building technology that meets merchants — and their customers — wherever they are.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DoorDash, Deliveroo, and Wolt will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about our legitimate recruiting process at &lt;span class=&quot;_80om1qgj _1e0c1nu9&quot; data-testid=&quot;smart-link-draggable-inline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;loader-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_1yt4x7n9 _2rko1ssi _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz13af _1rkwglyw _4cvx1w55 _19itia51 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b18uv _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehiw5lj _1j5pglyw _1di615s3&quot; href=&quot;https://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-resolved-view&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-icon-and-title&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw&quot;&gt;Recruitment Scam Awareness - DoorDash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; .&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a global creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce to create connected brands&amp;nbsp;that drive growth. Guided by a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Human First&lt;/strong&gt; philosophy, VML is known for its innovative work for brands and consistently ranks among the world’s leading creative companies, including the WARC Creative 100.&amp;nbsp;VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d4b7d1c3-8ad6-4b6d-ab45-d3cb5a3aebe1&quot;&gt;www.vml.com &lt;/a&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;a3ef68bf-16fb-4ebc-9ca9-406007d6cefc&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a meticulous, energetic &lt;strong&gt;Senior Project Manager&lt;/strong&gt; on a 3 month FTC to serve as the PMO engine room for an enterprise-level operational governance and business stabilisation programme across a major global account.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working alongside the Programme Director and Operations Leadership, you will orchestrate the PMO cadence, track cross-workstream milestones, and support commercial and operational controls that ensure our delivery is transparent, compliant, and rigorously evidenced.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run the Programme PMO:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain the integrated programme plan, milestone trackers, RAG reporting, RAID registers, executive minutes, and cross-functional action items.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Governance Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with Commercial and Finance teams to maintain burn-rate tracking, fee-type approval documentation, commercial reviews, and value-realisation reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Control &amp;amp; Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; Support Operations leads on governance forum charters, obligations registers, risk tracking, system access reviews, and standard operating procedure (SOP) documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audit &amp;amp; Assurance Readiness:&lt;/strong&gt; Support operational and compliance audit fieldwork by coordinating evidence requests, preparing walk-through packs, and tracking management actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evidence Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure records and reconciliations are accurate, structured, and up-to-date across Finance, Commercial, Tech, and delivery teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PMO Standards:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and refine reusable PMO templates, trackers, and governance processes that will transition into the ongoing operating model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High Operational Standards:&lt;/strong&gt; You build robust trackers, proactively chase actions, and quickly spot discrepancies when data or figures don&#39;t reconcile.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactive Problem-Solver:&lt;/strong&gt; Self-directed and energetic; you bring structure and clarity to ambiguous, fast-moving environments without waiting to be asked.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative Communicator:&lt;/strong&gt; Confident engaging cross-functional partners—including Finance, Legal, Delivery, and client counterparts—to obtain updates, evidence, and approvals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 6+ years in PMO, project management, or operational delivery within a fast-paced agency, consultancy, or large matrix enterprise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Governance &amp;amp; Financial Rigour:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience with RAID management, budget/burn-rate tracking, compliance documentation, and audit trail maintenance. Experience with AI-assisted productivity tools is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structured &amp;amp; Organised:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong documentation skills, capable of producing clear status reports and executive summaries that stakeholders can immediately act upon.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office an average of four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to VML. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a global creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce to create connected brands&amp;nbsp;that drive growth. Guided by a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Human First&lt;/strong&gt; philosophy, VML is known for its innovative work for brands and consistently ranks among the world’s leading creative companies, including the WARC Creative 100.&amp;nbsp;VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d4b7d1c3-8ad6-4b6d-ab45-d3cb5a3aebe1&quot;&gt;www.vml.com &lt;/a&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;a3ef68bf-16fb-4ebc-9ca9-406007d6cefc&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Senior Consultant with experience in Commerce ecosystems and technologies wanted to join our Business Services team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The opportunity:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How consumers discover, evaluate and buy products is changing faster than most organisations can respond. AI-powered search, agentic commerce, generative product discovery and the collapse of the traditional funnel are reshaping commercial models across every sector. Most enterprise clients know something has shifted, few have a clear plan for what to do about it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions is building a commerce consulting practice to help clients navigate these shifts. We work with some of the world&#39;s most recognised brands, translating complex commercial challenges into actionable strategies, transformation roadmaps and delivery programmes. What makes this role different from a boutique or a SaaS provider is what sits around you: your consulting recommendations connect directly to creative, content, CX and commerce execution teams who bring them to life. Strategy doesn&#39;t end at a slide deck here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Consultant who can own projects and client relationships. Someone who takes an ambiguous brief, structures it independently, drives the strategic direction and ensures the quality of everything the team delivers. You&#39;ll lead client conversations, design and facilitate workshops, and be the person mid-to-senior client stakeholders trust to connect diagnostic findings to commercial action. You&#39;ll also play a key role in growing the practice, spotting extension opportunities within accounts, contributing to pitches and coaching more junior members of the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perm&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;London/Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel to client site where required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Leadership &amp;amp; Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own medium-scale projects end-to-end: scope, quality, delivery timeline, and client relationship. Accountable for the strategic direction and the standard of output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of strategic recommendations across commerce transformation, AI discoverability (GEO/AEO), agentic commerce readiness, content strategy and channel optimisation - shaping the narrative, not just building the analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ambiguous or loosely defined briefs and structure them into clear project plans with defined deliverables, milestones and resource requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and codify delivery methodologies into repeatable, scalable frameworks the wider team can execute against.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and lead workshops, stakeholder interviews and co-creation sessions. You will be comfortable going off-script when the conversation requires it and steering senior client stakeholders toward actionable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted advisor to mid-to-senior client contacts. You are the person they call when they need the thinking sharpened or the direction challenged.&lt;br&gt;Anticipate and respond to client questions in a compelling and informed way. Own the client relationship day-to-day, identifying when senior escalation or support is needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Development:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify growth opportunities within existing accounts - spot the extension, the adjacent brief, the unasked question and work with senior leadership to convert them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute meaningfully to proposals and pitch responses: shaping the strategic approach, writing key sections, and presenting to prospective clients where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build client relationships that generate repeat work - not just deliver well, but leave clients wanting more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team &amp;amp; Practice Building:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and develop Consultants on the team: Setting the quality bar on projects, giving direct feedback, and creating opportunities for junior team members to stretch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role may line-manage 1–2 team members, depending on team structure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive practice IP development: reusable frameworks, case studies, proposition collateral and points of view that strengthen our market position and make selling easier.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across WPP&#39;s integrated network: connecting upstream consulting recommendations to downstream execution in content, CX and commerce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we want from you:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive professional experience, with a strong track record in consulting, strategy or senior commercial/digital roles (ideally blending both)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of how commerce ecosystems work: You&#39;ve either run a commerce operation (brand-side) or advised on one (agency/consulting-side). You understand how trading, content, category management, channel strategy and technology intersect in practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of AI discoverability: GEO, AEO, LLM-influenced discovery, AI assistants and conversational commerce. You can advise a Head of Digital or VP of eCommerce on what this shift means for their business and back it up with a credible action plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead projects independently - you&#39;ve managed scope, quality and client expectations without someone looking over your shoulder.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong strategic and analytical thinking: you can take a diagnostic output or a data-heavy assessment and turn it into a clear, commercially prioritised set of recommendations with a compelling narrative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and executive presence - you&#39;re comfortable leading a room, running a workshop, and navigating a difficult client conversation with credibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building methodology or practice IP: You&#39;ve created frameworks, playbooks or delivery approaches that others have adopted and scaled.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideally you will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brand-side experience in eCommerce, digital marketing or commercial leadership - you&#39;ve lived the reality of managing a P&amp;amp;L, running a digital operation, or leading a commerce team. This perspective is what separates a genuine consultant from a presenter of slides.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in at least two of: CPG/FMCG, Consumer health, Automotive, Retail, Telecom.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change management or enablement experience: you&#39;ve helped organisations adopt new operating models, not just designed them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Line management or mentoring experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If you know some of this, even better:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
