&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear &amp;amp; Decisive Communicator:&lt;/strong&gt; Calm under tight timelines, structured in problem-solving, and crisp in executive-level documentation and presenting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
