&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Stark, we forge the future of European and national security through cutting-edge, AI-driven technology and unmatched engineering precision. As a premier defence technology company, our mission is clear: to equip NATO Allies and their partners &amp;nbsp;with next-generation autonomous defence platforms and advanced AI-driven software built to perform in the world’s most demanding environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We believe that true security stems from relentless innovation. By combining elite engineering talent with agile technology and an AI-native operational culture, Stark turns complex defence challenges into field-tested, multi-domain solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;WHY JOIN US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The software and systems you work on directly protect personnel and defend European and national sovereignty.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will work alongside industry-leading minds on autonomous systems, advanced propulsion, and secure cyber platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We foster a fast-paced, collaborative environment where bold ideas are supported by serious R&amp;amp;D backing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a cross-functional engineering team powering our Counter-Unmanned Aerial Systems (C-UAS) program. Built on the background of the Minerva Edge CTRL team, our engineers create onboard edge software and integrated systems across core STARK platforms, delivering dependable performance when timing and accuracy matter most. Today, we are building the next-generation stack and physical integration for the STARK C-UAS platform at the intersection of hardware, real-time embedded systems, computer vision, and AI-driven navigation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Drone Engineer Working Student for Dragonfly, your mission is to bring our autonomous C-UAS systems to life in the physical world. Serving as a vital link between hardware development and software execution, you will assemble and refine our aerial platforms, design mechanical and electrical solutions, and build critical testing environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU WILL DO AT STARK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drone Assembly &amp;amp; Prototyping: Work closely alongside hardware engineers to assemble, wire, configure, and maintain C-UAS drone platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Electro-Mechanical Engineering: Tackle hands-on electrical and mechanical challenges, from circuit troubleshooting and sensor integration to structural adjustments and payload mounting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CAD &amp;amp; Prototyping: Utilize CAD/EDA tools to creatively prototype and iterate custom mechanical and hardware solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;QA Testing &amp;amp; Simulation: Conduct Quality Assurance testing on physical drone hardware and software integration, while maintaining Hardware-in-the-Loop (HiTL) and Software-in-the-Loop (SiTL) test environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Field Operations &amp;amp; Inventory: Support live flight-test campaigns in the field and manage procurement workflows and inventory for lab equipment and R&amp;amp;D parts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING TO THE MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Academic Background: Enrolled in a Bachelor’s or Master’s program in Aerospace, Mechanical, Electrical Engineering, Mechatronics, Robotics, or a related discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-On Hardware Skills: Practical familiarity with electronics, soldering, wiring, workshop tools, and mechanical assembly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineering Fundamentals: Solid foundation in mechanical/electrical engineering principles and eager to learn CAD/design software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Availability &amp;amp; Mindset: Pragmatic troubleshooting mindset, available up to 20 hours/week during semesters, and willingness to support local field testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NICE TO HAVE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior UAV / Robotics Experience: Building, maintaining, or piloting drones (FPV, multirotor, fixed-wing).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flight Control &amp;amp; Autopilot: Familiarity with PX4, ArduPilot, Betaflight, or ground control stations like QGroundControl.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design &amp;amp; Software Tools: SolidWorks, Fusion 360, KiCad, 3D printing, Linux, Python/C++, or ROS/ROS2.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re interested in building the future of European Defence with us, and you see yourself reflected on the description above, please send us your &lt;strong&gt;CV in English&lt;/strong&gt;. We&#39;re looking forward to meeting you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SECURITY CLEARANCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Due to the nature of our work in the defence sector, candidates must be eligible to obtain and maintain the appropriate security clearance required for this position. Details will be provided during the recruitment process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive workplace. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, colour, religion, sex, national origin, disability, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Stark, we forge the future of European and national security through cutting-edge, AI-driven technology and unmatched engineering precision. As a premier defence technology company, our mission is clear: to equip NATO Allies and their partners &amp;nbsp;with next-generation autonomous defence platforms and advanced AI-driven software built to perform in the world’s most demanding environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We believe that true security stems from relentless innovation. By combining elite engineering talent with agile technology and an AI-native operational culture, Stark turns complex defence challenges into field-tested, multi-domain solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;WHY JOIN US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The software and systems you work on directly protect personnel and defend European and national sovereignty.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will work alongside industry-leading minds on autonomous systems, advanced propulsion, and secure cyber platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We foster a fast-paced, collaborative environment where bold ideas are supported by serious R&amp;amp;D backing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The Flight Control Systems (FCS) Engineering team designs and delivers the hardware, real-time firmware, and flight software that keep STARK&#39;s unmanned aerial vehicles stable, responsive, and mission-ready across multiple platforms. We operate as a tight, cross-disciplinary group spanning hardware owners, real-time operating system (RTOS) engineers, guidance and control specialists, systems engineers, and flight test teams. As SW Engineer &amp;amp; Architect, you sit at the technical centre of that group, defining how the software layers fit together and writing core production code alongside your peers. We work close to real hardware on HIL benches and flight ranges, iterating rapidly while holding hard standards for timing, determinism, and flight safety.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;YOUR MISSION&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will own the embedded software architecture and core C++ implementation for STARK&#39;s modular Flight Control System family across multiple unmanned aerial vehicle platforms. Every architectural boundary you set directly governs flight stability, real-time determinism, and how rapidly STARK brings new airframes and sensor suites from bench prototype to live deployment. Working across hardware, RTOS, guidance, and flight test teams, you will pair disciplined safety-critical engineering with hands-on code delivery under defence-tech pace.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;WHAT YOU WILL DO AT STARK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Define and maintain the layered software architecture for STARK&#39;s modular Flight Control System family, separating hardware abstraction, RTOS services, middleware, and flight control applications across multiple UAV platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Design, implement, debug, and review deterministic, real-time C and modern C++ flight software, covering state machines, task scheduling, fault handling, and sensor-to-actuator data pipelines on microcontroller targets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Author and align interface control documents (ICDs), timing budgets, memory budgets, and failure-mode behaviour with Platform RTOS, FCS Hardware, Guidance and Control, and Systems Engineering teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Integrate flight software onto target microcontrollers, sensor interfaces, and embedded communication buses (CAN/CAN-FD, SPI, I2C, UART, Ethernet), isolating root causes on the hardware bench with debuggers, logic analysers, and oscilloscopes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Build testable software boundaries and automated verification gates across unit tests, static analysis, software-in-the-loop (SIL) simulation, and hardware-in-the-loop (HIL) rigs ahead of ground and live flight trials.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Establish pragmatic MISRA-aligned C/C++ coding guidelines and lead architecture and code reviews so the codebase stays maintainable as the FCS engineering team scales.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Support ground and live flight-test campaigns with telemetry log analysis, rapid defect resolution, and architectural improvements driven by real flight data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;WHAT YOU BRING TO THE MISSION&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;7+ years of professional experience in embedded software engineering and software architecture for real-time, high-reliability systems in aerospace, UAV/UAS, robotics, defence, or automotive.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Expert-level proficiency in modern C++ (C++14/17/20) and embedded C for resource-constrained hardware, including memory management, concurrency, and deterministic timing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Production experience with real-time operating systems (FreeRTOS, Zephyr, NuttX, VxWorks, or PikeOS) and designing portable hardware abstraction layers (HAL).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Proven track record architecting modular, multi-platform embedded software with clean cross-layer interfaces.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience integrating embedded software with microcontrollers (ARM Cortex-M/R or similar), sensors, and buses (CAN/CAN-FD, SPI, I2C, UART, Ethernet).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
