&lt;li&gt;A background in Data &amp;amp; AI engineering or architecture, with sufficient technical depth to have client conversations, shape solutions, validate estimates, and review the work of nearshore and offshore teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience owning the delivery of a Data &amp;amp; AI engagement with a nearshore or offshore team, including scope, budget, escalations, and client steering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working directly with decision-makers and driving Data &amp;amp; AI programs from business case through to delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to proposals and estimates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in German; Swiss German is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EU/EFTA citizenship or an existing Swiss work permit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing client connections or relevant experience in financial services firms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with financial services clients in Switzerland.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with legacy data warehouse migrations to Databricks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Databricks certification, or willingness to obtain certification within 3-6 months.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to practice building, for example through offerings, accelerators, talks, or mentoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Xebia&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;💡 &lt;strong&gt;Innovation potential:&lt;/strong&gt; At Xebia, the focus is on innovation and pioneering spirit. You can develop your creative ideas and share innovative thinking.&lt;/p&gt;
